    "permission": "Seymour Duncan encourages sharing wiring diagrams freely; commercial use needs prior written permission. LIMITATIONS: Generic series humbuckers use logical coil terminals, not lead colors/polarity. Bridge ground, cable, load omitted; no bridge terminal exists. Blade poles model selection logic, not physical terminals. Logical pot lugs and linear scale, not audio taper. Two tones and two capacitors exceed the one-tone limit, so the estimate is unavailable. PDF .047 uF uses the 47 nF setting."
